{"id":"cebc92aa41f3a49c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Lp Random Variable","display":"df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable — ZFC Prob4 Lp Random Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable — ZFC Prob4 Lp Random Variable","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable — ZFC Prob4 Lp Random Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md\">../batch01/58-df-integrability.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}\">\\(\\mathrm{PIntegrable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md\">../batch01/58-df-integrability.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}lp\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\operatorname{Bor}(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(X,p,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}lp\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\operatorname{Bor}(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(X,p,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-moment is imposed only after the probability space and\nmeasurability of the real-valued random variable have been declared.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PIntegrable}$ 取 [[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}lp\\text{-}random\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\operatorname{Bor}(\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(X,p,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1453,"backlinks":[{"id":"6cd614fd2298b74e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6986b08fe678f39","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable.md|58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8902399f82dbe8a2","d4d304b0bbb11c1a","7df291a6731ae8a3"]}